quation", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.322, 0.769, 0.719, 0.79], "content": "m _ {s - 1} ^ {2} p _ {s} ^ {2} - 1 \\equiv m _ {s - 1} ^ {2} - 1 + p _ {s} ^ {2} - 1 \\bmod 1 6"}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.087, 0.799, 0.252, 0.816], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由归纳假设可得"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.163, 0.824, 0.88, 0.861], "content": "\\frac {m ^ {2} - 1}{8} \\equiv \\frac {m _ {s - 1} ^ {2} - 1}{8} + \\frac {p _ {s} ^ {2} - 1}{8} \\equiv \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {s - 1} \\frac {p _ {i} ^ {2} - 1}{8} + \\frac {p _ {s} ^ {2} - 1}{8} \\equiv \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {s} \\frac {p _ {i} ^ {2} - 1}{8} \\bmod 2"}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.087, 0.871, 0.345, 0.905], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{2}{m}\\right)=(-1)^{\\frac{m^{2}-1}{8}}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.129, 0.915, 0.552, 0.933], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Jacobi 符号同样有类似二次互反律的性质。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 42, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.08, 0.056, 0.108, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "30"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.401, 0.055, 0.562, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.091, 0.09, 0.589, 0.107], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理1.27 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m, n > 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为奇数，且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(m, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.358, 0.121, 0.597, 0.152], "content": "\\left(\\frac {n}{m}\\right) \\left(\\frac {m}{n}\\right) = (- 1) ^ {\\frac {m - 1}{2} \\frac {n - 1}{2}}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.091, 0.172, 0.455, 0.211], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m = \\prod_{i=1}^{s} p_i"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = \\prod_{j=1}^{t} q_j"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.099, 0.217, 0.753, 0.31], "content": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\left(\\frac {n}{m}\\right) \\left(\\frac {m}{n}\\right) & = \\left[ \\prod_ {j = 1} ^ {t} \\prod_ {i = 1} ^ {s} \\left(\\frac {q _ {j}}{p _ {i}}\\right) \\right] \\left[ \\prod_ {i = 1} ^ {s} \\prod_ {j = 1} ^ {t} \\left(\\frac {p _ {i}}{q _ {j}}\\right) \\right] = \\prod_ {j = 1} ^ {t} \\prod_ {i = 1} ^ {s} \\left(\\frac {q _ {j}}{p _ {i}}\\right) \\left(\\frac {p _ {i}}{q _ {j}}\\right) \\\\ & = \\prod_ {j = 1} ^ {t} \\prod_ {i = 1} ^ {s} (- 1) ^ {\\frac {p _ {i} - 1}{2} \\frac {q _ {j} - 1}{2}} = (- 1) ^ {\\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {s} \\frac {p _ {i} - 1}{2} \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {t} \\frac {q _ {j} - 1}{2}} = (- 1) ^ {\\frac {m - 1}{2} \\frac {n - 1}{2}} \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.047, 0.316, 0.913, 0.354], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中最后一个等式用到如下性质: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\frac{m-1}{2}\\equiv\\sum_{i=1}^{s}\\frac{p_{i}-1}{2}\\bmod2,\\frac{n-1}{2}\\equiv\\sum_{i=1}^{t}\\frac{q_{j}-1}{2}\\bmod2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.047, 0.396, 0.917, 0.591], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendre 符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{a}{p}\\right)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可以用来判断同余式 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} \\equiv a \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是否有解。当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{a}{p}\\right) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} \\equiv a \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 恰有两个解。当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{a}{p}\\right) = -1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} \\equiv a \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 无解。然而 Jacobi 符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{a}{m}\\right)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 却只能用来否定 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} \\equiv a \\bmod m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是否有解，即当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{a}{m}\\right) = -1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} \\equiv a \\bmod m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 一定无解，但当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{a}{m}\\right) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} \\equiv a \\bmod m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可能无解也可能有解。例如，Jacobi 符号 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left(\\frac{-1}{9}\\right) = (-1)^{\\frac{9-1}{2}} = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，但 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} \\equiv -1 \\bmod 9"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一定无解的。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.051, 0.625, 0.459, 0.647], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1.6 数论在信息安全中的应用"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.048, 0.681, 0.92, 0.84], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "随着信息技术的不断发展和应用,信息安全的内涵也在不断的延伸,从最初的信息保密性发展到信息的完整性、可用性、可控性和不可否认性,进而发展到“攻(攻击)、防(防范)、测(检测)、控(控制)、管(管理)、评(评估)”等多方面的基础理论与技术。密码技术是信息安全的核心技术,涉及密码体制的设计与分析、身份认证、数字签名、密钥管理等多种安全范畴。本节主要介绍数论在密码体制设计与分析中的应用实例,包括代换密码、RSA算法、EIGamal算法的加解密原理及它们所用到的数论知识。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.097, 0.855, 0.357, 0.873], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. 代换密码及其数论基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.05, 0.882, 0.918, 0.929], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "代换密码是一类重要的古典密码体制,包括移位密码和仿射密码等特殊形式,同时也包括维吉尼亚密码和希尔密码等扩展形式。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 43, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.428, 0.059, 0.592, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.882, 0.061, 0.909, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "31"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.076, 0.094, 0.945, 0.224], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "代换密码的数学模型如下:设明文空间 P 和密文空间 C 均为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}=\\{0,1,2,\\cdots,25\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，即模 26 的非负最小完全剩余系的集合，密钥空间 K 是集合  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}=\\{0,1,2,\\cdots,25\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  上全体置换构成的集合。对任意密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\pi\\in K"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，加密变换定义为: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y=E_{\\pi}(x)=\\pi(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，解密变换定义为: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x=D_{\\pi}(y)=\\pi^{-1}(y)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，这里  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x\\in P"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  称为明文， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y\\in C"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  称为密文， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "E_{\\pi}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  称为密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  控制下的加密算法， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "D_{\\pi}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  称为密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  控制下的解密算法， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\pi^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\pi"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的逆置换。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.077, 0.231, 0.946, 0.305], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "代换密码的一个密钥刚好对应于26个数字的一个置换,所有可能的置换有26!种,这个数值超过了 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "4.0 \\times 10^{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,是一个很大的数字,因此采用穷尽密钥搜索的方法来获得密钥是比较困难的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.078, 0.313, 0.946, 0.387], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "代换密码的一个特殊形式是移位密码。移位密码的密钥就是集合  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}=\\{0,1,2,\\cdots,25\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  上的一个平移，平移当然是一个置换。设平移量为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k\\in Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则移位密码的加、解密变换就可以定义为如下形式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.122, 0.395, 0.91, 0.413], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = E_{k}(x) = x + k \\mod 26"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，解密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = D_{k}(y) = y - k \\mod 26"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.078, 0.423, 0.947, 0.496], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "特别的,当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = 3"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时,该移位密码通常叫做凯撒密码,它是两千多年前凯撒大帝所发明的密码,就是把字母表中的字母用排在它后面3位的字母来替换。使用移位密码来加密普通英文句子时,首先需要建立英文字母和模26的非负完全剩余系之间的一一对应关系,即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.37, 0.504, 0.656, 0.521], "content": "A \\leftrightarrow 0, B \\leftrightarrow 1, C \\leftrightarrow 2, \\dots , Z \\leftrightarrow 2 5"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.079, 0.532, 0.383, 0.55], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "两者之间的对应关系见表1.1。"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.082, 0.58, 0.944, 0.673], "content": [{"type": "table_caption", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.234, 0.561, 0.792, 0.577], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "表 1.1 26 个英文字母和模 26 的非负完全剩余系之间的对应关系"}]}, {"type": "table_body", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.082, 0.58, 0.944, 0.673], "content": "<table><tr><td>A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td><td>D</td><td>E</td><td>F</td><td>G</td><td>H</td><td>I</td><td>J</td><td>K</td><td>L</td><td>M</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>9</td><td>10</td><td>11</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>N</td><td>O</td><td>P</td><td>Q</td><td>R</td><td>S</td><td>T</td><td>U</td><td>V</td><td>W</td><td>X</td><td>Y</td><td>Z</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>14</td><td>15</td><td>16</td><td>17</td><td>18</td><td>19</td><td>20</td><td>21</td><td>22</td><td>23</td><td>24</td><td>25</td></tr></table>"}, {"type": "table_caption", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.123, 0.689, 0.812, 0.734], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 1.20 假设移位密码的密钥为 k = 11，试用移位密码加密如下明文\nWewillmeetatmidnight"}]}, {"type": "table_caption", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.082, 0.744, 0.3, 0.761], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "然后用解密变换验证。"}]}, {"type": "table_caption", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.124, 0.778, 0.884, 0.797], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 首先将明文中的字母根据表 1.1 对应于相应的整数,得到如下明文数字串"}]}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.124, 0.805, 0.901, 0.823], "content": "2 2 \\quad 4 \\quad 2 2 \\quad 8 \\quad 1 1 \\quad 1 1 \\quad 1 2 \\quad 4 \\quad 4 \\quad 1 9 \\quad 0 \\quad 1 9 \\quad 1 2 \\quad 8 \\quad 3 \\quad 1 3 \\quad 8 \\quad 6 \\quad 7 \\quad 1 9"}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.081, 0.833, 0.949, 0.878], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "然后将明文数字串中每一个数字都与11相加,再对其和数取模26运算,得到如下密文数字串"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.101, 0.887, 0.931, 0.905], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.101, 0.887, 0.931, 0.905], "content": "<table><tr><td>7</td><td>15</td><td>7</td><td>19</td><td>22</td><td>22</td><td>23</td><td>15</td><td>15</td><td>4</td><td>11</td><td>4</td><td>23</td><td>19</td><td>14</td><td>24</td><td>19</td><td>17</td><td>18</td><td>4</td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.081, 0.914, 0.819, 0.933], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "最后将密文数字串中的每一个数字根据表 1.1 转化为相应的字母, 得到密文"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 44, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.079, 0.055, 0.107, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "32"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.399, 0.053, 0.56, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.314, 0.088, 0.648, 0.105], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HPHTWWXPPELEXTOYTRSE"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.045, 0.115, 0.912, 0.161], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "将上面的过程逆回去, 只需要将密码数字串中每一个数字都减去 11 后取模 26 运算, 就可以将密文恢复成明文。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.091, 0.171, 0.568, 0.189], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果代换密码中的加、解密变换定义为如下形式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.091, 0.199, 0.498, 0.216], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = E_{k}(x) = ax + b \\mod 26"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.091, 0.227, 0.539, 0.245], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = D_{k}(y) = a^{-1}(y - b)\\bmod 26"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.046, 0.256, 0.914, 0.304], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a, b) \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{26}^{*} \\times \\mathbb{Z}_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_{26}^{*} = \\{a \\mid a \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{26}, (a, 26) = 1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 模 26 的乘法逆元, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{-1} \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{26}^{*}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 满足 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "aa^{-1} \\equiv 1 \\bmod 26"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 那么该代换密码称为仿射密码。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.091, 0.32, 0.855, 0.339], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 1.21 假设仿射密码的密钥为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left( {a,b}\\right)  = \\left( {7,3}\\right)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,试用仿射密码加密如下明文"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.366, 0.348, 0.594, 0.367], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Wewillmeetatmidnight"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.092, 0.383, 0.416, 0.401], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 由例1.20知，明文数字串为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.094, 0.411, 0.867, 0.429], "content": "2 2 \\quad 4 \\quad 2 2 \\quad 8 \\quad 1 1 \\quad 1 1 \\quad 1 2 \\quad 4 \\quad 4 \\quad 1 9 \\quad 0 \\quad 1 9 \\quad 1 2 \\quad 8 \\quad 3 \\quad 1 3 \\quad 8 \\quad 6 \\quad 7 \\quad 1 9"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.048, 0.438, 0.914, 0.485], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对明文数字串的每一位数字执行加密变换  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = E_{(7,3)}(x) = 7x + 3 \\mod 26"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  就可以得到密文数字串"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.135, 0.493, 0.83, 0.512], "content": "1 \\quad 5 \\quad 1 \\quad 7 \\quad 2 \\quad 2 \\quad 9 \\quad 5 \\quad 5 \\quad 6 \\quad 3 \\quad 6 \\quad 9 \\quad 7 \\quad 2 4 \\quad 1 6 \\quad 7 \\quad 1 9 \\quad 0 \\quad 6"}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.048, 0.521, 0.538, 0.539], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而得到密文为 BFBHCCJFFGDGJHYQHTAG。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.048, 0.548, 0.917, 0.679], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\left| {\\mathbb{Z}}_{26}\\right|  = {26},\\left| {\\mathbb{Z}}_{26}^{ * }\\right|  = \\varphi \\left( {26}\\right)  = {12}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,这表明移位密码的密钥量只有 26,仿射密 码的密钥量为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{12} \\times  {26} = {312}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,采用穷尽密钥搜索的方法就很容易攻破这两个密码体制。 尽管代换密码的密钥量为 26!, 是一个很大的数字, 但注意到英文单个字母或者多个字母 在英文句子中出现的频率具有明显特征,在收集大量密文的情况下,根据字母的频率分布 特征可以破译普通的代换密码。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.049, 0.687, 0.918, 0.789], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在上面介绍的移位密码和仿射密码中,一旦密钥确定,则每个字母对应的数字都被加密变换成对应的唯一数字,这种密码体制被称为单表代换密码。单表代换密码的缺陷是不能隐藏英文字母的频率分布规律。维吉尼亚密码和希尔密码是代换密码的扩展形式,通过多表代换的形式,克服单表代换密码的频率缺陷。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.049, 0.797, 0.917, 0.843], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "维吉尼亚密码的数学模型是: 设 m 是一个正整数, 定义明文空间、密文空间和密钥空间如下"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.143, 0.852, 0.825, 0.87], "content": "P = C = K = (\\mathbb {Z} _ {2 6}) ^ {m} = \\{(x _ {1}, x _ {2}, \\dots , x _ {m}) | x _ {i} \\in \\mathbb {Z} _ {2 6}, i = 1, 2, \\dots , m \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.05, 0.88, 0.735, 0.898], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对任意密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k=(k_{1},k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m})\\in K"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，加密变换和解密变换定义如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.094, 0.908, 0.911, 0.927], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(y_{1},y_{2},\\cdots,y_{m})=E_{k}(x_{1},x_{2},\\cdots,x_{m})=(x_{1}+k_{1},x_{2}+k_{2},\\cdots,x_{m}+k_{m})\\bmod26;"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 45, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.414, 0.061, 0.576, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.868, 0.063, 0.895, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "33"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.106, 0.096, 0.921, 0.115], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x_{1},x_{2},\\cdots,x_{m})=D_{k}(y_{1},y_{2},\\cdots,y_{m})=(y_{1}-k_{1},y_{2}-k_{2},\\cdots,y_{m}-k_{m})\\bmod26"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.062, 0.123, 0.93, 0.198], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "同样根据对应关系  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A \\leftrightarrow 0, B \\leftrightarrow 1, C \\leftrightarrow 2, \\cdots, Z \\leftrightarrow 25"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，将英文字母和模 26 的非负最小完全剩余系对应，则每个密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = (k_{1}, k_{2}, \\cdots, k_{m})"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  相当一个长度为 m 的字母串，该字母串称为密钥字。与单表代换密码不同，维吉尼亚密码一次加密 m 个明文字母。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.107, 0.213, 0.836, 0.26], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 1.22 假设 m = 6，密钥字为“cipher”，试用维吉尼亚密码加密如下明文 thiscryptosystemisnotsecure"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.063, 0.276, 0.931, 0.349], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解 根据英文字母和数字的对应规则,密钥字“cipher”对应的密钥为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k=(2,8,15,7,4,17)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。将明文串转化为对应的数字串,每6个为一组,使用密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k=(2,8,15,7,4,17)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  进行模26下的加法运算,如下所示:"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.067, 0.352, 0.921, 0.507], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.067, 0.352, 0.921, 0.507], "content": "<table><tr><td>19</td><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>18</td><td>2</td><td>17</td><td>24</td><td>15</td><td>19</td><td>14</td><td>18</td><td>24</td><td>18</td><td>19</td><td>4</td><td>12</td><td>8</td><td>18</td><td>13</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td>7</td><td>4</td><td>17</td><td>2</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td>7</td><td>4</td><td>17</td><td>2</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td>7</td><td>4</td><td>17</td><td>2</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>21</td><td>15</td><td>23</td><td>25</td><td>6</td><td>34</td><td>0</td><td>23</td><td>8</td><td>21</td><td>22</td><td>15</td><td>20</td><td>1</td><td>19</td><td>19</td><td>12</td><td>9</td><td>15</td><td>22</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>18</td><td>4</td><td>2</td><td>20</td><td>17</td><td>4</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>7</td><td>4</td><td>17</td><td>2</td><td>8</td><td>15</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>25</td><td>8</td><td>19</td><td>22</td><td>25</td><td>19</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.065, 0.512, 0.933, 0.559], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "则相应的密文为: VPXZGIAXIVWPUBTTMJPWIZITWZT。解密时, 使用相同的密钥字, 进行逆运算即可。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.066, 0.567, 0.935, 0.642], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据维吉尼亚密码的加密特点,破译该密码的关键在于如何确定密钥字的长度 m。一旦确定了密钥字的长度 m, 就可以将多表代换密码情形归结为单表代换密码情形, 然后使用频率分析法获取密钥字的每一个分量。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.066, 0.649, 0.938, 0.863], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Kasiski 测试法和重合指数法是确定密钥字长度 m 的两种有效方法。Kasiski 测试法主要基于这样一个事实: 如果两个相同的明文段加密成相同的密文段, 而它们的位置间距为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 那么必有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta \\equiv 0 \\mod m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。Kasiski 测试过程如下: 在获取大量密文的情况下, 搜索长度至少为 3 的相同的密文段, 记录这些密文段到起始点之间的距离, 假如得到如下几个距离:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta_{1}, \\delta_{2}, \\delta_{3}, \\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 那么, 可以猜测 m 为这些  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\delta_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的最大公因子的因子。重合指数法的基本原理是: 记  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "I_{c}(x)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是含 n 个字符的字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的重合指数, 即  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  中两个随机元素相同的概率。那么, 当字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是随机字符串时, 重合指数的取值具有如下特征为"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.354, 0.87, 0.653, 0.906], "content": "I _ {c} (x) \\approx 2 6 \\times \\left(\\frac {1}{2 6}\\right) ^ {2} = 0. 0 3 8"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.07, 0.915, 0.819, 0.934], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = x_{1}x_{2}\\cdots x_{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是英语文本字符串时，重合指数的取值具有如下特征"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 46, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.096, 0.056, 0.124, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "34"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.416, 0.054, 0.577, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.376, 0.089, 0.618, 0.129], "content": "I _ {c} (x) \\approx \\sum_ {i = 0} ^ {2 5} p _ {i} ^ {2} = 0. 0 6 5"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.062, 0.134, 0.903, 0.153], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_0, p_1, \\cdots, p_{25}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分别表示英文字母 A, B, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", Z 的概率, 它们的值分别如表 1.2 所示。"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.064, 0.185, 0.928, 0.479], "content": [{"type": "table_caption", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.226, 0.166, 0.767, 0.182], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "表 1.2 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{p}_{0},{p}_{1},\\cdots ,{p}_{25}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分别对应的英文字母 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "A,B,\\cdots ,Z"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的概率值"}]}, {"type": "table_body", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.064, 0.185, 0.928, 0.479], "content": "<table><tr><td>字母</td><td>概率(<eq>p_0 \\sim p_{12}</eq>)</td><td>字母</td><td>概率(<eq>p_{13} \\sim p_{25}</eq>)</td></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>0.082</td><td>N</td><td>0.067</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>0.015</td><td>O</td><td>0.075</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>0.028</td><td>P</td><td>0.019</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>0.043</td><td>Q</td><td>0.001</td></tr><tr><td>E</td><td>0.127</td><td>R</td><td>0.060</td></tr><tr><td>F</td><td>0.022</td><td>S</td><td>0.063</td></tr><tr><td>G</td><td>0.020</td><td>T</td><td>0.091</td></tr><tr><td>H</td><td>0.061</td><td>U</td><td>0.028</td></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>0.070</td><td>V</td><td>0.010</td></tr><tr><td>J</td><td>0.002</td><td>W</td><td>0.023</td></tr><tr><td>K</td><td>0.008</td><td>X</td><td>0.001</td></tr><tr><td>L</td><td>0.040</td><td>Y</td><td>0.020</td></tr><tr><td>M</td><td>0.024</td><td>Z</td><td>0.001</td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.063, 0.485, 0.93, 0.531], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "重合指数法的计算过程是:在获取大量密文的情况下,将密文字符串  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = y_{1}y_{2}y_{3}\\cdots"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  按如下方式分割成 m 个子串,即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.366, 0.541, 0.626, 0.674], "content": "\\begin{array}{c} y ^ {(1)} = y _ {1} y _ {m + 1} y _ {2 m + 1} y _ {3 m + 1} \\dots \\\\ y ^ {(2)} = y _ {2} y _ {m + 2} y _ {2 m + 2} y _ {3 m + 2} \\dots \\\\ y ^ {(3)} = y _ {3} y _ {m + 3} y _ {2 m + 3} y _ {3 m + 3} \\dots \\\\ \\vdots \\quad \\vdots \\\\ y ^ {(m)} = y _ {m} y _ {2 m} y _ {3 m} y _ {4 m} \\dots \\end{array}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.063, 0.683, 0.931, 0.729], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "然后分别计算每一个子串的重合指数,当每一个子串的重合指数均大约为 0.065 时,则 m 就是密钥字的长度。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.062, 0.738, 0.931, 0.843], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "不管是采用Kasiski测试法还是重合指数法,一旦得到了密钥字的长度m,就可以将密文串按上述方式分割成m个子串 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{(1)},y^{(2)},\\cdots,y^{(m)}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,对每一个子串 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{(i)}(1\\leqslant i\\leqslant m)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,统计每一个字母出现的频率,频率最高的字母一定是与字母E对应,从而可以确定移位量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,得到密钥字 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k=(k_{1},k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.062, 0.853, 0.932, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "希尔密码是另一种多表代换密码,其主要思想是利用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上线性变换将长度为m的明文串加密成长度为m的密文串。希尔密码的数学模型如下:设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m\\geqslant2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个正整数,明文空间P和密文空间C均为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(Z_{26})^{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,密钥空间K是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的所有m阶可逆矩阵的集合。对"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 47, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.419, 0.061, 0.581, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.873, 0.063, 0.901, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "35"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.066, 0.097, 0.888, 0.199], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "每一个密钥  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = \\begin{bmatrix} k_{11} & k_{12} & \\cdots & k_{1m} \\\\ k_{21} & k_{22} & \\cdots & k_{2m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ k_{m1} & k_{m2} & \\cdots & k_{mm} \\end{bmatrix} \\in K"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，定义如下的加密变换和解密变换分别为"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.11, 0.208, 0.762, 0.312], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密变换: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(y_{1},y_{2},\\cdots,y_{m})=(x_{1},x_{2},\\cdots,x_{m})\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc}k_{11}&k_{12}&\\cdots&k_{m}\\\\ k_{21}&k_{22}&\\cdots&k_{2m}\\\\ \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\ k_{m1}&k_{m2}&\\cdots&k_{mn}\\end{array}\\right]"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.113, 0.363, 0.22, 0.382], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解密变换:"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.222, 0.319, 0.783, 0.426], "content": "(x _ {1}, x _ {2}, \\dots , x _ {m}) = (y _ {1}, y _ {2}, \\dots , y _ {m}) \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} k _ {1 1} & k _ {1 2} & \\dots & k _ {m} \\\\ k _ {2 1} & k _ {2 2} & \\dots & k _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ k _ {m 1} & k _ {m 2} & \\dots & k _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right] ^ {- 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.114, 0.434, 0.464, 0.452], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "以上所有运算都是在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上进行的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.068, 0.462, 0.937, 0.594], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "需要注意的是, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上一个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 阶矩阵 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbf{A}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 具有逆矩阵当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(|\\mathbf{A}|, 26) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|\\mathbf{A}|"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示矩阵 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbf{A}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的行列式。采用唯密文攻击希尔密码是很困难的, 但如果已知一些明文和相应的密文, 则不难破译希尔密码。事实上, 假定敌手已经确认了正在使用的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 值, 并且至少有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个不同的明密文对, 设为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{j} = (x_{1j}, x_{2j}, \\cdots, x_{mj}), y_{j} = (y_{1j}, y_{2j}, \\cdots, y_{mj}), j = 1, 2, \\cdots, m"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果矩阵"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.368, 0.606, 0.635, 0.706], "content": "\\boldsymbol {x} = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} x _ {1 1} & x _ {1 2} & \\dots & x _ {1 m} \\\\ x _ {2 1} & x _ {2 2} & \\dots & x _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ x _ {m 1} & x _ {m 2} & \\dots & x _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right]"}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.069, 0.714, 0.618, 0.732], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "恰好是可逆矩阵,那么密钥矩阵 k 就可以由下式给出,即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.137, 0.742, 0.868, 0.846], "content": "\\boldsymbol {k} = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} k _ {1 1} & k _ {1 2} & \\dots & k _ {1 m} \\\\ k _ {2 1} & k _ {2 2} & \\dots & k _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ k _ {m 1} & k _ {m 2} & \\dots & k _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} x _ {1 1} & x _ {1 2} & \\dots & x _ {1 m} \\\\ x _ {2 1} & x _ {2 2} & \\dots & x _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ x _ {m 1} & x _ {m 2} & \\dots & x _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right] ^ {- 1} \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c c c} y _ {1 1} & y _ {1 2} & \\dots & y _ {1 m} \\\\ y _ {2 1} & y _ {2 2} & \\dots & y _ {2 m} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ y _ {m 1} & y _ {m 2} & \\dots & y _ {m m} \\end{array} \\right]"}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.071, 0.854, 0.624, 0.873], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不构成可逆矩阵, 则必须重新选择 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个明密文对。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.115, 0.889, 0.381, 0.907], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2. RSA 算法及其数论基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.115, 0.916, 0.941, 0.935], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在上面介绍的四类代换密码中,加密密钥和解密密钥是相同的或者由加密密钥很容"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 48, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.089, 0.057, 0.116, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "36"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.41, 0.056, 0.57, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.054, 0.091, 0.925, 0.357], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "易得到解密密钥,比如移位密码的加密密钥和解密密钥均为 k; 仿射密码的加密密钥为 (a,b), 解密密钥为 ( "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{-1},b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ), 这里  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  为 a 模 26 的乘法逆元; 维吉尼亚密码的加密密钥和解密密钥均为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k=(k_{1},k_{2},\\cdots,k_{m})"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ; 希尔密码的加密密钥为  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Z_{26}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  上可逆矩阵 k, 解密密钥为 k 的逆矩阵  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。20 世纪 70 年代以前的密码, 都是采用加密密钥和解密密钥相同或者实质相同的密码, 这样的密码称为对称密码或者私钥密码, 也就是说这一类密码的加密密钥和解密密钥的地位是对称的, 在实施过程中必须保证密钥的私有性, 除加解密双方外, 其他人不能知道密钥。1976 年, Diffie 和 Hellman 提出了公钥密码的思想, 指出加密密钥可以公开, 解密密钥需要保密。其安全性依赖于已知加密密钥求解密密钥在计算性上是不可行的。1978 年, Rivest、Shamir 和 Adleman 提出了第一个成熟的也是比较完整的公开密钥密码体制——RSA 算法, 该算法的安全性依赖于大整数分解困难性问题。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.055, 0.365, 0.925, 0.465], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RSA 算法的数学模型是: 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p, q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为两个大的素数, 明文空间 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "P"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和密文空间 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 均为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}_n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 密钥空间为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "K = \\{(n, p, q, e, d) \\mid ed \\equiv 1 \\bmod \\varphi(n)\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中加密密钥 (亦称公钥) 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n, e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 解密密钥 (亦称私钥) 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p, q, d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。对任意密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k = (n, p, q, e, d) \\in K"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 加密变换和解密变换定义如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.1, 0.474, 0.824, 0.492], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密变换为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = E_{k}(x) \\equiv x^{e} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，解密变换为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = D_{k}(y) \\equiv y^{d} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.101, 0.501, 0.749, 0.519], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "首先,利用数论知识验证 RSA 算法的加密和解密是一对互逆运算。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.057, 0.528, 0.923, 0.601], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in \\mathbb{Z}_n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，反之亦成立。如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，根据欧拉定理得到:"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{\\varphi(n)} \\equiv 1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。又注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed \\equiv 1 \\bmod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed = k\\varphi(n) + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为某个正整数，故"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.234, 0.61, 0.751, 0.628], "content": "y ^ {d} \\equiv (x ^ {e}) ^ {d} \\equiv x ^ {e d} \\equiv x ^ {k \\varphi (n) + 1} \\equiv (x ^ {\\varphi (n)}) ^ {k} x \\equiv x \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.057, 0.638, 0.923, 0.684], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, n) \\neq 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 有且仅有一个成立。根据中国剩余定理，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立当且仅当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 同时成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.057, 0.692, 0.925, 0.738], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq 0 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 也就是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, q) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这时 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{q-1} \\equiv 1 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.364, 0.747, 0.621, 0.765], "content": "y ^ {d} \\equiv x ^ {e d} \\equiv 0 \\equiv x \\bmod p"}, {"type": "equation", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.127, 0.774, 0.844, 0.792], "content": "y ^ {d} \\equiv x ^ {e d} \\equiv x ^ {k \\varphi (n) + 1} \\equiv x ^ {k \\varphi (n)} x \\equiv x ^ {k (q - 1) (p - 1)} x \\equiv (x ^ {q - 1}) ^ {k (p - 1)} x \\equiv x \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.058, 0.802, 0.663, 0.82], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y^{d} \\equiv x \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。类似地，当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\equiv 0 \\bmod q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，结论也成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.058, 0.83, 0.926, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其次,利用数论知识说明已知加密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n,e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 难以得到解密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,q,d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。根据 RSA 算法的数学模型,由加密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n,e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 得到解密密钥 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,q,d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,一种方式是分解大整数 n = pq,如果分解了大整数 n,就可以得到两个素因子 p 和 q,同时可以计算出欧拉函数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)=\\varphi(pq)=\\varphi(p)\\varphi(q)=(p-1)(q-1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,从而根据辗转相除法由  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed\\equiv1\\bmod\\varphi(n)"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 49, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.417, 0.062, 0.578, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.871, 0.063, 0.898, 0.076], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "37"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.065, 0.097, 0.934, 0.308], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "及 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值。另一种方式是计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果有办法在不分解 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的情况下得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，一方面可以由 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "ed \\equiv 1 \\bmod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 及 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的取值。另一方面，注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n) = (p - 1)(q - 1) = pq - (p + q) + 1 = n - (p + q) + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，也就是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 满足如下两个条件:"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "pq = n, p + q = n - \\varphi(n) + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，这说明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是二次方程 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2} - (n - \\varphi(n) + 1)x - n = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的两个零点。通过求解该二次方程，可以得到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的素因子 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，从而得到解密密钥。分解大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是破译 RSA 算法的关键，然而这两个问题一直是数论中十分困难的问题。根据上面的分析，分解大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是等价的，只要解决了其中一个问题，那么另一个问题也就解决了。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.111, 0.316, 0.577, 0.333], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "最后,利用数论知识分析 RSA 算法的实现效益。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.111, 0.343, 0.448, 0.36], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RSA 参数生成算法可以描述如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.161, 0.37, 0.473, 0.388], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 生成两个大素数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.161, 0.398, 0.591, 0.415], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\leftarrow pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n) \\leftarrow (p-1)(q-1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.162, 0.425, 0.772, 0.443], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 选取一个随机数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e(1 < e < \\varphi(n))"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(e, \\varphi(n)) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.164, 0.453, 0.428, 0.47], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d \\leftarrow e^{-1} \\mod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.164, 0.48, 0.552, 0.497], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step5:公钥为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n,e)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，私钥为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,q,d)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.112, 0.507, 0.428, 0.524], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "RSA 加解密算法可以描述如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.164, 0.534, 0.468, 0.552], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "加密: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = E_{k}(x) \\equiv x^{e} \\mod n;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.164, 0.562, 0.471, 0.58], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "解密: "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x = D_{k}(y)\\equiv y^{d}\\bmod n"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.068, 0.59, 0.937, 0.718], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在 RSA 参数生成算法和加解密算法的实施过程中, 有些计算是容易的, 比如给定两个大素数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "q"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 计算它们的乘积 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = pq"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 已知正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "e"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 通过辗转相除法计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d = e^{-1} \\bmod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "; 有些计算是相对困难的, 如对于大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如何计算模运算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "? 如何寻找大的素数? 有些计算是非常困难的, 比如如何分解大整数? 在不知道大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的分解式的条件下, 如何计算欧拉函数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.069, 0.726, 0.936, 0.855], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "人们知道计算机是有字长限制的,在计算机上不能直接得到两个大整数的和、差、积、商,但通过计算机编程可以将大整数分段成小整数来表示,利用小整数的四则运算来实现大整数的四则运算。也就是说,在计算机上已知两个大素数 p 和 q,计算它们的乘积 n = pq 是很容易的一件事;同样,给定正整数 e 和  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  通过辗转相除法计算  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "d = e^{-1} \\mod \\varphi(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  也是一件容易的事。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.069, 0.863, 0.938, 0.936], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于给定的大整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 直接计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{a} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的效率是非常低的。这是因为当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 非常大时, 进行 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 次模乘运算需要非常多的运算时间。目前通常采用如下方法来计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{a} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 该方法称为重复平方法。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.087, 0.059, 0.114, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "38"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.407, 0.058, 0.568, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.097, 0.093, 0.521, 0.11], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "首先将模指数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 用二进制形式表示出来，即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.297, 0.12, 0.672, 0.16], "content": "a = \\sum_ {i = 1} ^ {l - 1} c _ {i} 2 ^ {i} = c _ {0} + c _ {1} 2 + \\dots + c _ {l - 1} 2 ^ {l - 1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.053, 0.166, 0.428, 0.184], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{i} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 或 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1, c_{l - 1} \\neq 0, 0 \\leqslant i \\leqslant l - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.099, 0.194, 0.153, 0.211], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "于是"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.326, 0.223, 0.649, 0.269], "content": "x ^ {a} = x ^ {\\sum_ {i = 0} ^ {l - 1} c _ {i} 2 ^ {i}} = \\prod_ {i = 0} ^ {l - 1} (x ^ {2 ^ {i}}) ^ {c _ {i}} \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.053, 0.276, 0.921, 0.329], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "根据上面的表达式, 只需将 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c_{i} = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对应的那些项 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2^{i}}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 做模乘运算, 并且在执行模乘运算过程中, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2^{i}}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可以利用前面得到的项 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^{2^{j}} (j < i)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 通过多次平方得到。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.053, 0.338, 0.925, 0.747], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "给定一个大整数 n，如何判定 n 是否为素数，这就是素性测试问题。目前素性测试方法有很多，但它们可以划分为两类，一类是概率算法，另一类是确定性算法。前者可以在允许任意小出错概率的前提下判定 n 的素性，即如果判定 n 为素数，则 n 仍然可能不是素数，只是这种可能性非常小。而后者的判定总是对的，即如果判定 n 为素数，那么 n 一定是素数。从理论上而言，总希望找到一个确定性算法来判定 n 的素性。从实际应用而言，希望所采用的算法在计算上是可行的。一个算法的运算时间总是可以表示为需要解决问题的规模的函数，如果这个函数是多项式函数，那么称该算法是多项式时间的算法，也就是通常所指的计算上可行的算法。否则称为(亚)指数时间的算法。素性测试的概率算法一般是多项式时间的算法，这些算法的理论基础简单(只涉及初等数论的知识)，实际应用广泛，如 Solovay-Strassen 算法和 Miller-Rabin 算法。素性测试的确定性算法通常是指数时间的算法，其理论基础较为复杂(利用代数数论方面的知识)，如 Jacobi 素性测试和椭圆曲线素性测试。值得一提的是，2002 年，印度理工学院的 Agrawal、Kayal 和 Saxena 三人提出了一种多项式时间的确定性的素性测试法，简称 AKS 算法。AKS 算法原理简单，采用初等数论的知识，但在实际实现时较为复杂，其运算时间比 Miller-Rabin 算法要慢很多。下面介绍 Miller-Rabin 算法和 AKS 算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.1, 0.755, 0.605, 0.773], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Miller-Rabin 算法基于如下的基本概念和基本定理。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.054, 0.791, 0.923, 0.868], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 1.14 设 n>2 是一个奇数， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n-1=2^{s}m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，其中 s 是一个非负整数，m>0 为奇数。对于小于 n 的正整数 b 来说，如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b^{m}\\equiv1\\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  或者存在整数  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r(0\\leqslant r<s)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，使得  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b^{2^{r_{m}}}\\equiv-1\\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，那么称 n 通过以 b 为基的 Miller-Rabin 测试。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.056, 0.885, 0.924, 0.931], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.28 设 p>2 是一个素数, 则对任意正整数 b, 只要  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p,b)=1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 则 p 一定可以通过以 b 为基的 Miller-Rabin 测试。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 51, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.425, 0.061, 0.586, 0.077], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.878, 0.063, 0.904, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "39"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.116, 0.096, 0.438, 0.114], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 利用Fermat小定理即可。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.074, 0.132, 0.938, 0.193], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.29 如果 n>2 是一个奇合数，则至多有  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\frac{n-1}{4}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  个 b(0<b<n)，使得 n 通过以 b 为基的 Miller-Rabin 测试。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.116, 0.209, 0.325, 0.227], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 参见文献[3]。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.073, 0.236, 0.938, 0.282], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n > 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个奇数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n - 1 = 2^{s} m"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "s"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个非负整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m > 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为奇数。Miller-Rabin 素性测试算法可以描叙如下:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.116, 0.291, 0.517, 0.309], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 随机选取  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\in \\{1, 2, 3, \\cdots, n-1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.116, 0.319, 0.402, 0.335], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\leftarrow 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "z \\leftarrow b^{m} \\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.117, 0.345, 0.921, 0.363], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 z=1 或者 z=n-1，那么 n 通过测试，n 可能是素数，则结束；否则转 Step3。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.117, 0.373, 0.686, 0.391], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r = s - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是合数，则结束；否则转 Step4。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.118, 0.401, 0.421, 0.417], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4:  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\leftarrow r + 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ;  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "z \\leftarrow z^{2} \\mod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.117, 0.428, 0.791, 0.445], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "z = n - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 通过测试，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可能是素数，则结束；否则转Step3。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.073, 0.455, 0.941, 0.584], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上述算法的输出为“n 是合数”或者“n 可能是素数”。根据定理 1.29，该算法判定 n 是素数的正确性概率至少为 75%，出错概率小于 25%。如果随机均匀地选取序列  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b_{1}, b_{2}, \\cdots, b_{k} \\in \\{1, 2, \\cdots, n-1\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，对 n 进行 k 次 Miller-Rabin 素性测试，如果每次输出都为“n 可能是素数”，则 n 是合数的概率小于  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/4^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。当 k 足够大时， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1/4^{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是一个非常小的数，也就是说 Miller-Rabin 算法能够以非常小的出错概率判定正整数的素性。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.117, 0.592, 0.758, 0.61], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AKS算法基于如下定理，该定理仍是Fermat小定理的一个推论。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.118, 0.627, 0.88, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理1.30 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为变量, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a, n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是两个正整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数当且仅当"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.378, 0.655, 0.635, 0.671], "content": "(x + a) ^ {n} \\equiv x ^ {n} + a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.118, 0.689, 0.64, 0.707], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_n^r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 表示 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的组合数，由二项式定理有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.388, 0.718, 0.629, 0.755], "content": "(x + a) ^ {n} = \\sum_ {r = 0} ^ {n} C _ {n} ^ {r} x ^ {r} a ^ {n - r}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.075, 0.76, 0.942, 0.878], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数时, 对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r (1 \\leqslant r \\leqslant n - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(r, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(r!, n) = ((n - r)!, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。注意到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_{n}^{r} = \\frac{n!}{r!(n - r)!}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n! = C_{n}^{r} r!(n - r)!"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\mid C_{n}^{r} r!(n - r)!"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\mid C_{n}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "C_{n}^{r} \\equiv 0 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。又由 Fermat 小定理, 当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(a, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a^{n} \\equiv a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x + a)^{n} \\equiv x^{n} + a \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.074, 0.886, 0.942, 0.933], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "反过来,如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不是素数,则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 必有素因子 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p < n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p'"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是整除 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的最大次幂, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p'|n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p^{t+1} \\nmid n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 那么 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p' \\nmid C_n^p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(p^t, a^{n-p}) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x+a)^n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的二项式展开式中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x^p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的系数不"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 52, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.085, 0.058, 0.113, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "40"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.405, 0.055, 0.566, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.052, 0.09, 0.367, 0.108], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "为0,矛盾！从而n一定是素数。"}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.051, 0.117, 0.919, 0.217], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.30 提供了一个素性测试的确定性算法,但该方法不能在多项式时间内完成,主要原因是计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{\\left( x + a\\right) }^{n}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 需要计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个二项式系数。对于充分大的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,计算二项式系数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{C}_{n}^{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是非常困难的。为避免这个难解性问题,一个简单的方法就是在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{\\left( x + a\\right) }^{n} \\equiv  {x}^{n} + a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " mod "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的两边同时模去形如 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "{x}^{r} - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的多项式,其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为一恰当选择的小整数,即有"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.313, 0.225, 0.915, 0.244], "content": "(x + a) ^ {n} \\equiv x ^ {n} + a \\bmod [ n, x ^ {r} - 1 ]\\tag{1.1}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.052, 0.253, 0.921, 0.38], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "显然，n 为素数当且仅当对所有的 a 和 r 均有式(1.1)成立。现在的问题是:对于一些合数 n，它也可能对部分 a 和 r 使得式(1.1)成立。为解决这一问题，AKS 证明了:若对于特定的 r，式(1.1)能够对很多 a 成立的话，则 n 必是素数的方幂，并且 r 的大小和 a 的个数都可以限制在  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\log n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  的多项式级。从而得到了如下多项式时间的确定性素性测试算法——AKS 算法。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.098, 0.389, 0.663, 0.407], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = a^{b}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为正整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b > 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为合数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.055, 0.416, 0.92, 0.461], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: 找出最小的正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{ord}_{r}(n) > 4(\\log n)^{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这里 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{ord}_{r}(n)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n^{k} \\equiv 1 \\mod r"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立的最小正整数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.099, 0.47, 0.633, 0.488], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 若对某些 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\leqslant r, 1 < (a, n) < n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为合数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.056, 0.497, 0.921, 0.547], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4: 若 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n \\leqslant r"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数 (只有当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 较小时, 才可能发生这种情形, 因为由数论中的结果可以证明, 一定存在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "r \\leqslant [\\sqrt{16} \\log^5 n]"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathrm{ord}_r(n) > 4(\\log n)^2)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.057, 0.558, 0.922, 0.604], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step5: 对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 从 1 到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "[2\\sqrt{\\varphi(r)}\\log n]"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 执行: 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x + a)^{n} \\equiv x^{n} + a \\bmod n, x^{r} - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不成立, 则输出 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是合数, 否则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是素数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.056, 0.613, 0.925, 0.795], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "给定一个大整数 n，如何得到 n 的标准分解式，这就是大整数分解问题。相比素性测试问题，大整数分解问题更加困难。当前最有效的三种大整数分解算法是二次筛法、椭圆曲线法和数域筛法，这三个算法都不是多项式时间的算法。椭圆曲线法基于 Pollard 的 p-1 分解法，借助于椭圆曲线上丰富代数结构来分解大整数。二次筛法和数域筛法基于 Dixon 的随机平方法，借助于其他高深的数学工具筛选出随机平方法中所需要的正整数对，从而对大整数进行分解。下面介绍 Pollard 的 p-1 分解法和 Dixon 的随机平方法，这两种分解方法只需要一些简单的数论知识即可。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.057, 0.803, 0.926, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pollard 的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p - 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 分解法的基础仍是 Fermat 小定理。假设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是待分解的正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个素因子, 则对于任意正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "1 < a < p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p \\mid (a^{p-1} - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": 