text", "content": " 的一个非平凡因子。Dixon 的随机平方法的关键是如何找到正整数对 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(s, t)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "s^2 \\equiv t^2 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 但 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "s \\neq t \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。分解基算法、二次筛法和数域筛法都是采用这一思想。分解基算法描叙如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.079, 0.425, 0.943, 0.471], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: 选择一个适当的正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 记全体不超过 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的素数为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_{1}, p_{2}, \\cdots, p_{k}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B = \\{p_{0}, p_{1}, p_{2}, \\cdots, p_{k}\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p_{0} = -1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。通常称集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为分解基;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.122, 0.482, 0.79, 0.5], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2:随机选择整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{i}, x_{i} > \\sqrt{n} / 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{i} \\equiv x_{i}^{2} \\bmod n, |v_{i}| \\leqslant n / 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.079, 0.51, 0.945, 0.6], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 可以在 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中完全分解, 即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{i} = \\prod_{j=0}^{k} p_{j}^{a_{ij}}, p_{j} \\in B"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 这时称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 数, 否则重新选择 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 直到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 数。令指数向量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{i} = (a_{i0}, a_{i1}, \\cdots, a_{ik}) \\in \\mathbb{Z}^{k+1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 其中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a_{i0} = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 或者 1 , 将指数向量的每一个分量模 2 后得到向量仍记为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 并保存此时的 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{i}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.079, 0.61, 0.947, 0.683], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4: 如果得到了 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "k + 2"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "B"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{1}, v_{2}, \\cdots, v_{k+2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和相应的模2指数向量 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{k+2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 构造矩阵 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "G = (\\alpha_{1}, \\alpha_{2}, \\cdots, \\alpha_{k+2})"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 求解齐次线性方程组 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "Gx = 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 得到非零解 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\beta"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 不妨假设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\beta"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中的非零分量为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\beta_{1}, \\beta_{2}, \\cdots, \\beta_{m}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "v_{1}v_{2} \\cdots v_{m}"}, {"type": "text