 {"type": "text", "content": " 已经给定, 它们是公开信息。Alice 和 Bob 将通过公开信道协商一个密钥, 其做法如下。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.076, 0.401, 0.945, 0.447], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step1: Alice 随机选择正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a (1 < a < p - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 予以保密, 计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g^{a} \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 并将它发给 Bob;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.077, 0.457, 0.945, 0.502], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step2: Bob 随机选择正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b(1 < b < p - 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，予以保密，计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g^{b} \\mod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 并将它发给 Alice;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.122, 0.513, 0.684, 0.53], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step3: Alice 收到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g^{b} \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 后, 计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(g^{b})^{a} \\equiv g^{ab} \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.122, 0.541, 0.668, 0.559], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Step4: Bob 收到 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g^{a} \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 后, 计算 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(g^{a})^{b} \\equiv g^{ab} \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.077, 0.569, 0.947, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "那么,协议中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g^{ab} \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 就是 Alice 和 Bob 通过公开信道协商的密钥。第三方从公开信道上可以获取 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g^a \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "g^b \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 同时也知道素数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 及模 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "co