"F_{2}^{8}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 上的代数运算而设计的,美国数字签名标准 DSA 算法是基于有限群上的离散对数问题而设计的。掌握代数学的基本理论与方法,对于从事信息安全理论与应用研究有着十分重要的作用。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 60, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.1, 0.055, 0.127, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "48"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.42, 0.054, 0.581, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.064, 0.113, 0.358, 0.135], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2.1 群的定义与例子"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.065, 0.17, 0.932, 0.217], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "群是带有一种代数运算,并且满足一定运算规则的代数结构,那么什么是代数运算呢?"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.065, 0.232, 0.935, 0.306], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义2.1 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是一个非空集合, 如果存在一种法则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 对于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中任意两个元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 和 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 按照这种法则都有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中唯一的一个元素 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 与它们对应, 则称这种法则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "M"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中一个代数运算, 记做 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c = f(a, b)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 简记为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c = a \\cdot b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.065, 0.321, 0.933, 0.422], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "整数的加法、减法、乘法都是整数集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": 